### Important Considerations for Older Versions

Since Node.js v17 is now end-of-life (EOL), please keep a few things in mind:

* **Security:** EOL versions no longer receive security updates. Avoid using these in production environments.
* **Compatibility:** Some modern dependencies (especially native modules or packages relying on recent OpenSSL versions) may fail to compile or install on very old Node versions.
* **Managing versions:** You can list all installed versions at any time by running `nvm list`. You can switch back to the latest 17.x version at any time using `nvm use 17`.

